pdatedAt":"2025-12-16T11:13:09.685Z","creator":{"name":"Mxt Towers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15065600784,"name":"Pit Crew Simulator","desc":"XP bonus on private servers!\n\nNumerous changes made to make playing in public servers easier. See social links for more info\n\n- Red button on the left side of the pit stall to spawn car\n- Timer ends when all 4 tires are fully changed - If the engine gets louder, drop the jack!\n\n2023 CUP SERIES TEAM UNIFORMS AND HELMETS CAN BE PURCHASED WITH GAMEPASSES OR UNLOCKED BY PLAYING\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/32643239/Pit-Crew-Simulator#!/store\nCar/Pit stall customisation is free in VIP servers, but you need 1,000xp to do it in public\n\n---IF YOU ARE BANNED, READ FAQ CHANNEL IN SOCIAL LINKS, YOU WILL BE UNBANNED---\n\n*Asset credits listed in social links\n**In light of recent affiliated endeavours with ROBLOX developers, it is important to note that this game is NOT affiliated with the NASCAR brand\n\nTags: Pit Crew, Stock Car, Pit Stop, Next Gen, Team, Multiplayer, Refuelling, Teamwork, Racing, Pits, Mechanic, Engineer, Car","path":"/game/15065600784-pit-crew-simulator","slug":"15065600784-pit-crew-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8bdfeb876cccfa893bd7d91c257bc6085424a6b5d4ffb5155ac365e96fb52120.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d5289b600daf9474c94b78ecc7690af5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":5985007,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-09T14:22:23.900Z","creator":{"name":"Pit Crew Simulator","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4572543057,"name":"SCI - Pathos III","desc":"Special Containment Procedures Foundation\nSECURE. CONTAIN. PROTECT.\n─────────────────────────────────\nWelcome to SCI - Pathos III, one of the most well-known SCP Foundations within the Roblox SCP Genre.\nPathos III is the designation of an installation of facilities created by the SCP Foundation located deep within the Pacific Ocean. The exact depth of the facility remains classified. \n\nBy creating cutting-edge technology and pioneering new containment procedures for the Foundation abroad, this installation contains some of the most dangerous anomalies. It is considered one of the most well-kept strongholds in human history and provides the Foundation with a unique testbed for interactions with anomalous entities and artifacts.\n─────────────────────────────────\n! 𝐀𝐓𝐓𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 !\nThe player begins the game as a Class D used in anomalous experiments by the SCP Foundation. In order to join the Foundation, you must apply for Security Class 0. ","path":"/game/4572543057-sci-pathos-iii","slug":"4572543057-sci-pathos-iii","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0a0134956f06d0b61ab94be9bf9d61ec6808bbda1c1d5722b1d1d93571730e6c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bda4bc59091a135397b7ed9eeac392d8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":7254890,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-06T22:19:19.309Z","creator":{"name":"[SCPF - Special Containment Procedures Foundation]","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13694267880,"name":"Noobs Vs Zombies: Legions (Beta)","desc":"Welcome to Noobs Vs Zombies: Legions! A fan made game which combines elements from your favorite games: NVZ Realish and NVZ Tycoon 2!\n\nNVZ Realish: https://www.roblox.com/games/527271999/Noobs-vs-Zombies-Realish\nTycoon 2: https://www.roblox.com/games/2639055821/Noobs-vs-Zombies-Tycoon-2\n\nGame is in partial development. Though not complete, it may not always be worked on.\n\nType /votekick in the chat to vote-kick exploiters or rule-breakers!\n\nCredit to HeadKing for Heavy Light Armor, ManLostInDarkness for Mutant Knight Model\nThumbnails made by KingAtlec, GIBUSHAT4, WaffleTUBE10\n\nIf you need to purchase a Twinedhealer89 gamepass, here is his place: https://www.roblox.com/games/12911064470/Storage-Place","p